WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:07.100
11 sensor channels entering one part, and a single perception output leaving it.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:16.100
7 RGB cameras at 8 megapixels over GMSL2, road left and road right, 120-degree side cameras,

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:20.100
a dash cam, a driver monitoring camera, and a rear camera.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:26.100
Two thermal cameras beside them, front and rear 4D radar at 77 GHz.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:35.100
Watch them converge on the die, 9 cameras and 2 radars fused into one AD2 perception output in real time.

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:43.100
The bar underneath is the whole argument, 8.6 milliseconds consumed out of a 33.3 millisecond frame.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:53.100
74% of every frame is left unused, and that headroom is why one tapeout becomes 15 products rather than 15 programs.
